"""
Kiru - the open-source AMV maker. Single-file Flask app.

Everything runs on this machine only:
  - Server binds to 127.0.0.1 (not reachable from the network)
  - No CDNs, fonts or scripts are loaded from the internet
  - All working files live in ./_temp next to this script

Temp policy:
  - ./_temp is wiped when the app starts and when it closes
  - Unsaved exports in ./_temp/exports are deleted after 2 hours
  - A saved export is deleted from temp as soon as its download finishes

Output: 16:9, 9:16, 1:1, 4:5 or 21:9 at 30 fps (H.264 / HEVC / ProRes / VP9).
Templates you save live in ./templates, queued exports in ./Exports.
"""

